00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:48.480
What I wanted to write was...

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:52.440
But everyone threatened me.

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:55.280
"Write your stories in your style."

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:58.940
"That's all you can do, after all."

00:20:58.940 --> 00:21:03.610
I got so tired of writing.

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:05.730
Of living.

00:21:05.730 --> 00:21:09.480
What is "my style?"

00:21:09.480 --> 00:21:13.320
And then I met him.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:18.150
The ideal you, as you envision it.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:21.230
That's "your style."

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:23.070
Is that okay?

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:25.230
It is.

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:28.230
Forget the words of those around you.

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:31.440
Be true to yourself.

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:35.190
I created for myself, within my suffering,

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:41.230
a single friend who could
speak to me from the heart.

00:21:41.230 --> 00:21:42.530
Yes.

00:21:42.530 --> 00:21:46.150
Another me, within me.

00:21:49.650 --> 00:21:50.940
I'm...

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:56.900
Beyond the Pale of Vengeance

00:21:53.900 --> 00:21:56.900
Beyond the Pale of Vengeance

00:23:27.570 --> 00:23:29.360
Literary Gourmet!

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:31.730
<i>Kiki-Kitsune</i> Udon is hard to say!

00:23:32.220 --> 00:23:35.390
Kitsune Udon: Got its name because the fried
tofu it contains was a favorite of foxes ( <i>Kitsune</i> ).

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:35.780
A clear broth and a light taste.

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:37.480
I don't even need to slurp the noodles.

00:23:37.480 --> 00:23:39.400
This is the Kansai-style dish.

00:23:39.400 --> 00:23:41.070
That's right, Kan!

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:43.610
"Sniff sniff"

00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:43.780
People with sommelier certification are amazing.

00:23:43.780 --> 00:23:44.650
Yup.

00:23:44.650 --> 00:23:47.280
The written exam. The oral exam. The tasting.

00:23:47.280 --> 00:23:50.570
I've overcome many trials! I am invincible!

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:53.610
Eat more, and you too can be like me!

00:23:53.610 --> 00:23:55.070
Yeah, I'll do my best!

00:23:55.070 --> 00:23:58.320
I've never heard of a <i>kitsune</i> udon sommelier.

00:23:58.320 --> 00:24:00.650
Akutagawa- <i>san</i> 's been tricked again.
